{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44116450",
      "title": "Extracting Query Parameters via Inputs",
      "lectureOrder": 287,
      "videoOrder": 274,
      "sourceHash": "4ef28ba66d664a764ce54090f5e3643f2c26e995e5713b491244a8ed33481677",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.51,
          "end": 2.79,
          "en": "So setting query parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.79,
          "end": 5.79,
          "en": "is pretty straightforward.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.79,
          "end": 7.818,
          "en": "How can you now extract",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.818,
          "end": 11.133,
          "en": "the currently active query parameters, though?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.27,
          "end": 15.42,
          "en": "Well, in two main ways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.42,
          "end": 19.14,
          "en": "If you got componentInputBinding enabled,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.14,
          "end": 21.72,
          "en": "as we do in this demo app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.72,
          "end": 25.713,
          "en": "you can simply add a new property to your Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.64,
          "end": 30.51,
          "en": "a new property that has the name of your query parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.51,
          "end": 31.953,
          "en": "For example, order.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.09,
          "end": 36.51,
          "en": "Order, because that is the query parameter name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.51,
          "end": 37.713,
          "en": "I chose here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.97,
          "end": 40.35,
          "en": "If you chose a different name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.35,
          "end": 42.123,
          "en": "you'll need a different input name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.26,
          "end": 47.04,
          "en": "And this is then an input which is not required here though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.04,
          "end": 48.99,
          "en": "because it's absolutely possible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.99,
          "end": 51.87,
          "en": "that we don't have a query parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.87,
          "end": 53.91,
          "en": "But if we got one, it will be a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.91,
          "end": 58.91,
          "en": "that's either asc or desc, at least in my app here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.73,
          "end": 62.163,
          "en": "these are the two kinds of values I wanna set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.87,
          "end": 66.84,
          "en": "So order then is a signal that contains a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.84,
          "end": 70.41,
          "en": "that's either asc or desc or undefined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.41,
          "end": 73.56,
          "en": "which it would be initially, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.56,
          "end": 77.643,
          "en": "Now this input will now be set automatically by Angular,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.38,
          "end": 83.133,
          "en": "thanks to this setting here in our router configuration,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.03,
          "end": 85.8,
          "en": "and therefore in the template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.8,
          "end": 88.92,
          "en": "we can now set the value of the query parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.92,
          "end": 91.74,
          "en": "when the user clicks the link dynamically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.74,
          "end": 96.36,
          "en": "depending on the current value of this query parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.36,
          "end": 99.81,
          "en": "So we can now read that order input which we just added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.81,
          "end": 104.81,
          "en": "read that signal, and check if it's asc for ascending.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 106.02000000000001,
          "end": 110.94,
          "en": "If that's the case, I wanna set order to desc,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 110.94,
          "end": 113.463,
          "en": "otherwise I'll set it to asc.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 114.50999999999999,
          "end": 119.34700000000001,
          "en": "So if order is undefined or desc, it'll be set to asc.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 120.24,
          "end": 124.083,
          "en": "If it is set to asc, it'll be set to desc.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 124.98,
          "end": 127.23,
          "en": "So that should make sure that this link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 127.23,
          "end": 129.9,
          "en": "attaches different query parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 129.9,
          "end": 132.303,
          "en": "depending on what we currently have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 133.23,
          "end": 136.98,
          "en": "And therefore the text here should also change dynamically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 136.98,
          "end": 139.8,
          "en": "Here I can use string interpolation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 139.8,
          "end": 144.3,
          "en": "to read my order and check if it's ascending,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 144.3,
          "end": 148.02,
          "en": "in which case I want to output sort Descending.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 148.02,
          "end": 150.66,
          "en": "So I wanna output the text Descending here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 150.66,
          "end": 152.763,
          "en": "otherwise the text Ascending.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 155.13,
          "end": 157.35,
          "en": "So that overall the text changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 157.35,
          "end": 160.71,
          "en": "as this query parameter value changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 160.71,
          "end": 165.12,
          "en": "With that, if we reload, here for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 165.12,
          "end": 168.66,
          "en": "you can see that it says sort ascending at the beginning,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 168.66,
          "end": 172.56,
          "en": "and if I click this, this query parameter with a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 172.56,
          "end": 176.403,
          "en": "of asc was added, and this text here now changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 177.48,
          "end": 181.05,
          "en": "If I now click it, this query parameter value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 181.05,
          "end": 183.093,
          "en": "also changed to desc.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 183.99,
          "end": 185.7,
          "en": "So that's working the way it should,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 185.7,
          "end": 188.79,
          "en": "thanks to this automatic input binding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 188.79,
          "end": 191.16,
          "en": "But as mentioned, that's just one way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 191.16,
          "end": 194.163,
          "en": "of getting hold of that query parameter value.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
